                UNCFIndicatorEndDate = new DateTime(2023, 12, 31, 0, 0, 0, 0, DateTimeKind.Utc),
                Indicators = "Robust system in place for identifying, mapping and prioritizing vulnerable populations for assistance during a disaster",
                Baseline = "No (2018)",
                Narrative = "1. The thematic report on young people provides specific recommendations for the government to reap the benefits of demographic dividend, including: upgrading skills, particularly for females entrepreneurial skills; revising the SRH strategic plan; promoting mental health; strengthening inter-departmental/agency (horizontal) collaborations; enhancing data quality; and establishing a dedicated “National Youth Fund” as one of the flagship projects of SDGs 2030. In addition, an outline for a thematic report on \"Current Situation and Future Prospects of Elderly: Bhutan Ageing Report, 2022\" was developed, keeping in view of the increasing proportion of elderly population in future and understanding the current status of the older persons in terms of their income, health, social security and living arrangements. This will help inform appropriate policy and programmatic responses for the wellbeing of this vulnerable segment of the society.  2. Bhutan Statistical Database System (BSDS) was strengthened   to monitor and report the Five-Year Plans at grassroot level. The BSDS was piloted in two dzongkhags to test  improved data collection, formats and data flow plan from Gewogs to Dzongkhags and from Dzongkhags to NSB. 3.  Agriculture Extension Officers from 19 dzongkhags are better able to feed dzongkhag agricultural information with the help of Mobile Operational Data Acquisition Platform (MODA).",
